Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.99,0:06:20.99,pos,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,55,0,200,500,5200)\pos(60,200)\frz-90\1c&H552625&}由绮她
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.79,0:06:56.40,pos,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,155,0,200,500,5200)\pos(575,170)\frz-90\1c&H552630&}由绮以外？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.02,0:06:56.40,pos,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,200,500,5200)\pos(70,190)\frz-90\1c&H552630&}还是说…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.96,0:08:06.20,pos,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,200,500,5100)\pos(590,100)\frz-90\1c&H662625&}再 见
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.21,0:08:06.68,pos,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,200,500,5200)\pos(475,150)\frz-90\1c&H662625&}筱冢小姐
